//MCQs

::Spark-RDD::
How to sort the RDD dataset in descending order?{
    ~ rdd.sortBy(lambda x \: x, true)
    ~ rdd.sort(lambda x \: x)
    ~ rdd.sortBy(lambda x \: x)
    = rdd.sortBy(lambda x \: x, false)
}


::Spark-RDD::
If we have an initial dataset as "sc.parallelize([10, 25, 13, 6, 18, 21])", then which of the following code will return the elements which are less than 15?{
    ~ rdd.filter(lambda number \: number > 15)
    = rdd.filter(lambda number \: number <15)
    ~ rdd.reduce(lambda number \: number <\= 15)
    ~ rdd.distinct()
} 


::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following operation doesn't result into shuffle of data over the network?{
    ~ groupByKey()
    ~ reduceByKey()
    ~ repartition()
    = flatMap()
}

